SDL-E1011 (spec/README.md#design-rules-settled)

  x clause `strict` is a flag — write `strict;` (no value, no block)
   ,----
 1 | database blog { strict: true; };
   :                  ^^^|^^
   :                     `-- this clause takes a different form
   `----
  help: the separator picks the clause form: `key: <value>;`, bare `key;` (flag), or `key { … };` (sub-block) — spec rule 2
